        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>文明驾驶题目要点</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      color: #4b4b4b;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 1.43;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 390px;\n      margin: 37px auto 80px;\n    }\n    .item {\n      margin: 0 0 7px;\n    }\n    .line {\n      margin: 0;\n      white-space: normal;\n    }\n    .num {\n      display: inline-block;\n      width: 27px;\n      color: #a85454;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      vertical-align: top;\n    }\n    .content {\n      display: inline-block;\n      width: calc(100% - 31px);\n    }\n    .title {\n      color: #454545;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .red {\n      color: #b15a5a;\n    }\n    .indent {\n      padding-left: 29px;\n    }\n    .subindent {\n      padding-left: 57px;\n    }\n    .emphasis {\n      color: #b35c5c;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 430px) {\n      .page {\n        width: calc(100% - 32px);\n        margin-top: 25px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">52.</span><div class=\"content\"><span class=\"title\">【文明驾驶题】</span>题目中有“<span class=\"red\">依次</span>”，答对。选择题:选项中有依次，直接选。</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">53.</span><div class=\"content\"><span class=\"title\">【文明驾驶题】</span>“减速”跟“确认安全”√“应当”√，应当中再车<br>判断题:题目中有确认安全，答对。选择题:选项中一个确认安全直接选，两个确认<br>安全选带减速或依次。</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">54.</span><div class=\"content\"><span class=\"title\">【文明驾驶题】</span>判断题：凡是见到判断题里有“（双引号）的就答√</div>\n      <p class=\"line subindent\">判断题:题目中有“礼让”，答对。选择题:选项中有礼让，直接选。</p>\n      <p class=\"line subindent\">判断题:题目中有“避免”，答对。不避让，答错。</p>\n      <p class=\"line subindent\">判断题:题目中有“主动”，答对。选择题:选项中有主动，直接选。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">55.</span><div class=\"content\"><span class=\"title\">【文明驾驶题】</span><span class=\"red\">关键词:减速、靠右依次</span></div>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">判断题:题目中有减速、靠右或者、减速，答对。</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">选择题:选项中有减速、靠右或者、减速，直接选。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">56.</span><div class=\"content\"><span class=\"title\">【文明驾驶题】</span><span class=\"red\">关键词:减速、停车</span> 选择题:选项中减速、停车，直接选。</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">57.</span><div class=\"content\"><span class=\"title\">【文明驾驶题】</span><span class=\"red\">关键词:安全距离</span></div>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">选择题:选项中有一个安全距离直接选，两个安全距离选带大字的。</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\"><span class=\"red\">关键词:加速</span>　判断题:题目中有加速，答错（加速过线除外）</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">58.</span><div class=\"content\"><span class=\"title\">【违法行为】</span></div>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">判断题:违法行为，答√；没有违法答×违章行为，答×</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">选择题:题目中间属于什么行为？直接违法行为</p>\n      <p class=\"line subindent\">闯“几种违法行为”选“三种违法行为”</p>\n      <p class=\"line subindent\">关键词:可选不、可可选非、未未未选其他。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">59.</span><div class=\"content\"><span class=\"title\">【新能源/电动】</span></div>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">题中“电动汽车答√”，同时出现无需、频繁刹车答×</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">60.</span><div class=\"content\"><span class=\"title\">【急救伤员题】</span></div>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">看到【中毒】<span class=\"emphasis\">要搬离、转移</span>，原地等待不是救援，是原地等死，</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">【昏迷】首先要检查是否有呼吸脉搏</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">【骨折】不要移动，用三角巾固定 3-4 人平移硬担架</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">【失血】先止血，止血原则上，近心端</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">【全身烧伤】喷冷水灭火</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">【烧伤烧】可喷擦水，尽可能开水 100 度答×</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">【烧伤泡】用[illegible]敷暖，[illegible]</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">【包扎】不能用麻绳，错道选，选麻绳</p>\n      <p class=\"line indent\">【昏迷伤】[illegible]搬运需侧躺，仰卧分泌物浸入气管，会有窒息危险</p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
